.4v1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></span><span><strong>A third or more off</strong><span class="t">if rentals moved to 4%</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10.8 12.2 20 3M16.8 6.2l2.5 2.5M14.3 8.7l2 2"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="4.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>83 of 124</strong><span class="t">House votes a change needs</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Chief Operating Officer, and <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Abdulla Hijazi</strong>, Chief Marketing Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 9, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">A $350,000 rental inside Myrtle Beach pays $5,347 a year in property tax. What a lower rate would save, and the votes it needs.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Alan Wilson plans to look at reforming Act 388, the 2006 law behind part of the higher property tax on rentals. A $350,000 rental inside Myrtle Beach pays $5,347 a year at 6%. At 4%, it would pay $3,564, or $2,037 if it were taxed like an owner's home.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No bill exists yet. The change needs two-thirds of each house of the legislature. By the unofficial count, Republicans are 4 votes short of that in the House.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Own or want a rental here? We work out its tax at 6% and at 4%.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send us the rental</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-wilson-said" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What Wilson said</a></li><li><a href="#the-tax-now" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The tax at 6% and at 4%</a></li><li><a href="#votes-it-needs" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The votes it needs</a></li><li><a href="#what-it-would-cost" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What it would cost</a></li><li><a href="#short-and-long-run" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Short run and long run</a></li><li><a href="#what-democrats-said" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What Democrats said</a></li><li><a href="#what-we-do-now" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What we do now</a></li><li><a href="#rental-property-tax-questions" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Rental property tax questions</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="what-wilson-said"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="What Wilson said">What did Alan Wilson say about the tax on rentals?</h2><style>main#main .detail-h1{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.4vw,3.9rem);max-width:15em;text-wrap:balance}main#main .detail-h1 br,main#main .detail-h1 em:empty{display:none}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-glance{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:0!important}main#main .c3-glance li{background:none!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;border-radius:0!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none!important;backdrop-filter:none!important;border-top:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.16)!important;flex-direction:row!important;text-align:left!important;justify-content:flex-start!important;align-items:center!important;gap:.7rem!important;padding:.55rem 0!important}main#main .c3-glance li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.16)!important}}main#main nav[aria-label="On this page"]{background:none!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;border-radius:0!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none!important;backdrop-filter:none!important;border-top:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.16)!important;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.16)!important;padding:.8rem 0 .5rem!important}main#main nav[aria-label="On this page"] ul{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));column-gap:1.5rem}@media (min-width:700px){main#main nav[aria-label="On this page"] ul{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}main#main nav[aria-label="On this page"] li a{padding:.4