ree summer concerts and golf cart parades down Ocean Boulevard. Nightly rentals are allowed only on the blocks near the ocean. The inland streets, with bigger lots under the trees, are for living in or renting by the year.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Live there, rent it, or both? Tell us. We send the homes that fit.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Surfside%20Beach">Send me Surfside Beach homes</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="living-here"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Living here">What is it like to live in Surfside Beach?</h2><style>
